WEBVTT

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:00.856
(Kulgu)

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:03.536
Va sizga monelik qiladigan 3-bahona -

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.776
u sizni yoqtirmaydi.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:06.016
Siz unga yoqmaysiz.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.176
(Kulgu)

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.496
Va bu sodir bo'lishi mumkin.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.816
Lekin hatto bu siz uchun muhim ma'lumot bo'lib,

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:17.896
homiy bilan navbatdagi suhbatga tayyorlanishda

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:21.360
oz bo'lsada salmoqliroq xizmat qiladi.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.656
Homiyga ega bo'lishning ahamiyatini ta'riflarshga til ojiz.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:29.976
Bu sizning kasbiy o'sishingizdagi muhim munosabatdir.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.856
Murabbiyga ega bo'lish ochig'i zo'r ish,